00000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">资产</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.798em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4763em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>四项里最后一项常被忽略：<strong>3D 资产的成本是持续的</strong>——每一季新品都要做新资产，而转化增益是一次性观测到的。资产摊销的成本模型见 <a href=\"ar-asset-coverage-priority\">3D/AR 覆盖品类优先级</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量设计\">度量设计</h2><h3 id=\"三个必须分开的指标\">三个必须分开的指标</h3><p>把「用了 AR 的人转化更高」当成因果结论是这类功能最常犯的统计错误，因为<strong>使用 AR 的人本来就更可能买</strong>（他们是高意愿、爱探索的用户）。所以度量必须处理自选择偏差。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>使用率</td>\n<td>曝光到查看器的用户中真正打开 AR 的比例</td>\n<td>判断入口与体验门槛</td>\n<td>曝光定义不一致会导致不可比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>组内转化差</td>\n<td>使用者 vs 未使用者的转化率差</td>\n<td>描述性，不能作因果</td>\n<td>自选择偏差，通常明显高估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>随机曝光实验</td>\n<td>随机让部分用户看到/看不到 AR 入口</td>\n<td>因果推断</td>\n<td>需要足够样本与足够长的观测窗</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>随机曝光实验</strong>是唯一能给因果结论的方法。它的设计要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>随机化的单位是用户还是会话？</strong> 按会话随机会导致同一用户在不同会话看到不同体验，产生混淆；按用户随机更干净但要更长的招募期。</li>\n<li><strong>观测窗口必须覆盖退货期</strong>。如果退货窗口是 30 天，实验的分析周期就不能少于 45–60 天，否则你测到的转化增益里混着还没发生的退货。</li>\n<li><strong>对照组不是「什么都不给」，而是「正常商品页」</strong>。很多实验把对照变成「看不到 3D 但看得到劣化版页面」，人为抬高实验组。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 用户级随机分组 + 覆盖退货窗口的同群对照&#10;WITH cohort AS (&#10;  SELECT u.user_id,&#10;         u.group_flag,                       -- 随机分配: &#39;ar_visible&#39; | &#39;control&#39;&#10;         u.assigned_at&#10;    FROM exp_ar_entry u&#10;   WHERE u.assigned_at &gt;= $1 AND u.assigned_at &lt; $2&#10;),&#10;orders AS (&#10;  SELECT o.user_id,&#10;         o.order_id,&#10;         o.gmv,&#10;         o.placed_at,&#10;         COALESCE(r.refund_amount, 0) AS refund_amount,&#10;         COALESCE(r.refunded_at, NULL) AS refunded_at&#10;    FROM orders o&#10;    LEFT JOIN refunds r ON r.order_id = o.order_id&#10;   WHERE o.placed_at &gt;= $1&#10;     AND o.placed_at &lt; $2::timestamptz + INTERVAL &#39;60 days&#39;   -- 覆盖退货窗口&#10;)&#10;SELECT c.group_flag,&#10;       COUNT(DISTINCT c.user_id)                                   AS users,&#10;       COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id)                                  AS orders,&#10;       SUM(o.gmv)                                                  AS gmv,&#10;       SUM(o.refund_amount)                                        AS refunds,&#10;       SUM(o.gmv - o.refund_amount)                                AS net_revenue,&#10;       SUM(o.refund_amount) / NULLIF(SUM(o.gmv), 0)                AS refund_rate&#10;  FROM cohort c&#10;  LEFT JOIN orders o ON o.user_id = c.user_id&#10; GROUP BY c.group_flag;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 用户级随机分组 + 覆盖退货窗口的同群对照</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cohort </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">group_flag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,                       </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 随机分配: 'ar_visible' | 'control'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">assigned_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exp_ar_entry u</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">assigned_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> u</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">assigned_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gmv</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">placed_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">refund_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> refund_amount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">refunded_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> refunded_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> refunds r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">placed_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">placed_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'60 days'</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   -- 覆盖退货窗口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">group_flag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> users,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gmv</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                                  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gmv,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">refund_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> refunds,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gmv</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">refund_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> net_revenue,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">refund_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">gmv</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> refund_rate</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cohort c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders o </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">group_flag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>net_revenue</code> 与 <code>refund_rate</code> 两列必须同时看。只看 <code>gmv</code> 会漏掉「转化涨了但退货涨得更多」的情形。</p>\n<h3 id=\"退货原因是可消费的数据\">退货原因是可消费的数据</h3><p>度量体系要能闭环，前提是<strong>退货原因结构化</strong>。用户填「太小」是可用信号；填「不合适」是噪声。所以退货流程的原因选项设计直接决定推荐系统能否自我改进（见 <a href=\"../ar-tryon-size/size-recommend-avatar-fit\">尺码推荐与人台匹配</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>原因类目</th>\n<th>是否可消费</th>\n<th>对推荐系统的用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>尺码偏小 / 偏大</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>直接修正该用户在该款上的尺码偏移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与描述不符</td>\n<td>是（需细分）</td>\n<td>定位到资产/文案质量问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>颜色与图片不符</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>触发渲染色彩保真排查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>质量/做工问题</td>\n<td>否（非推荐相关）</td>\n<td>转售后，不进推荐闭环</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单纯不喜欢</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>无信息量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表说明了一件事：<strong>「降退货」的目标不能笼统地压给虚拟体验团队</strong>。只有「尺码偏小/偏大」「与描述不符」「颜色不符」这几类是虚拟体验能影响的，其余需要售后与品控处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"影响机制的拆解\">影响机制的拆解</h2><h3 id=\"试穿在哪个环节起作用\">试穿在哪个环节起作用</h3><p>把用户旅程拆开，可以看到虚拟体验作用于三个具体节点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>节点</th>\n<th>干预</th>\n<th>可观测指标</th>\n<th>典型机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>详情页停留</td>\n<td>3D 查看器可旋转</td>\n<td>停留时长、交互率</td>\n<td>提供额外信息，延长浏览</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>决策</td>\n<td>尺码推荐 / AR 试戴</td>\n<td>加购率、下单率</td>\n<td>降低不确定性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>售后</td>\n<td>更准确的尺码</td>\n<td>退货率、换货率</td>\n<td>减少信息性退货</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>值得强调的是第三个节点：<strong>虚拟体验的价值有相当一部分体现在售后，而不是下单</strong>。如果只考核下单转化，团队会倾向把体验做得「更好看」而不是「更准确」，长期反而抬高退货。所以 KPI 设计要把两个方向都纳入。</p>\n<h3 id=\"什么时候是净负效应\">什么时候是净负效应</h3><p>有几类情形下虚拟体验可能得不偿失：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>生成不实</strong>：2D 生成式试穿可能让衣服显得比实际合身（见 <a href=\"../ar-tryon-size/apparel-shoe-fit-tryon\">服装与鞋的虚拟试穿</a>）。如果生成模型在训练数据上偏向「理想体型」，输出会系统性美化。</li>\n<li><strong>色彩失真</strong>：如果渲染管线没有做色调映射保真，用户看到的颜色与实物不符，会产生「颜色不符」类退货。PBR Neutral 这类保真色调映射的价值正在于此（见 <a href=\"../3d-asset-production-spec/gltf-usdz-material-spec\">容器、材质与精度规格</a>）。</li>\n<li><strong>体验摩擦</strong>：需要授权摄像头、需要下载大模型、低端机加载失败——这些摩擦会把一部分用户推走，净效应为负。这就是为什么 <a href=\"../asset-sku-serving/edge-cloud-render-fallback\">端/云渲染与性能降级</a> 的兜底链是功能成立的前提。</li>\n<li><strong>成本高于收益</strong>：长尾品类资产成本高、销量低，摊销不过来。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>最后一条是资源分配问题，需要按品类做投入产出计算，见 <a href=\"ar-asset-coverage-priority\">3D/AR 覆盖品类优先级</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"报告与归因\">报告与归因</h2><h3 id=\"别引用无法核验的第三方数字\">别引用无法核验的第三方数字</h3><p>行业报告里流传的「AR 提升转化 94%」「降低退货 40%」这类数字，几乎都缺少可核验的方法说明：样本量、对照组设计、观测窗口、口径定义通常都不公开。把它们写进商业案例会带来两个后果：一是被质疑时无法辩护，二是把团队的目标设在一个从未被真实测量过的基线上。</p>\n<p>正确的做法是<strong>建立自己的基线</strong>。可行的一条最小路径：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>选 3–5 个 SKU 做<strong>随机曝光实验</strong>，观测窗口 ≥ 60 天。</li>\n<li>主指标定为 <code>net_revenue</code>（GMV − 退款），辅助指标为加购率、下单率、退货率、退款原因分布。</li>\n<li>用同期未受干预的相似 SKU 做辅助对照，检查是否存在外溢（用户可能在实验组看到 AR 后去别处下单）。</li>\n<li>实验结论只对实验覆盖的品类与人群外推。</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# 实验报告最小字段集（缺任何一项都不能称因果结论）&#10;experiment_id, hypothesis, unit_of_randomization, sample_size_per_arm,&#10;exposure_definition, observation_window_days,&#10;primary_metric, primary_metric_effect, confidence_interval,&#10;secondary_metrics: [add_to_cart_rate, order_rate, refund_rate, net_revenue],&#10;refund_reason_breakdown, external_validity_notes\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 实验报告最小字段集（缺任何一项都不能称因果结论）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>experiment_id, hypothesis, unit_of_randomization, sample_size_per_arm,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>exposure_definition, observation_window_days,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>primary_metric, primary_metric_effect, confidence_interval,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>secondary_metrics: [add_to_cart_rate, order_rate, refund_rate, net_revenue],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>refund_reason_breakdown, external_validity_notes</span></span></code></pre></div><p>字段 <code>unit_of_randomization</code> 与 <code>observation_window_days</code> 的缺失是最常见的报告缺陷——前者决定结论强度，后者决定退货是否被计入。</p>\n<h3 id=\"归因的实际困难\">归因的实际困难</h3><p>3D/AR 的归因有两个结构性困难：</p>\n<p><strong>跨设备</strong>。用户在手机上试穿 AR，可能后来在桌面端下单。如果按设备归因，手机端的 AR 使用看起来没有转化，而桌面端的转化看起来与 AR 无关。</p>\n<p><strong>延迟转化</strong>。家具 AR 摆放的用户往往当场不下单，而是过几天量完尺寸再买。归因窗口太短会系统性低估。</p>\n<p>对策是<strong>用户级归因 + 足够长的窗口</strong>，而不是会话级或设备级。这要求身份体系能跨设备关联，属于用户身份域的职责。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>2025 年美国零售退货总额 8499 亿美元，线上退货率 19.3%、整体 15.8%，服装鞋类因尺码难判断高于平均——「信息性退货」是虚拟体验能直接影响的部分。</li>\n<li>净收益 = 转化增益 − 退货成本变化 − 履约成本变化 − 资产摊销；四项必须同时纳入，只看转化会系统性高估。</li>\n<li>度量必须区分三组指标：使用率（入口与门槛）、组内转化差（描述性、有自选择偏差）、随机曝光实验（唯一能支撑因果结论）。</li>\n<li>随机曝光实验的设计要点：随机化单位（用户优于会话）、观测窗口必须覆盖退货期（30 天退货窗对应 ≥ 45–60 天分析期）、对照组是正常商品页而非劣化页。</li>\n<li>退货原因必须结构化才能形成闭环，且只有「尺码偏小/偏大」「与描述不符」「颜色不符」几类是虚拟体验能影响的，其余归售后与品控。</li>\n<li>虚拟体验的价值有相当部分体现在售后（退货率）而非下单；只考核转化的 KPI 会诱导团队把体验做得更好看而非更准确。</li>\n<li>净负效应的四种来源：生成不实、色彩失真、体验摩擦、资产成本高于收益。</li>\n<li>不要引用无法核验方法的第三方百分比；自建基线的最小路径是 3–5 个 SKU 的随机曝光实验 + 60 天观测 + <code>net_revenue</code> 主指标。</li>\n<li>覆盖哪些品类先做，见 <a href=\"ar-asset-coverage-priority\">3D/AR 覆盖品类优先级</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"试穿对转化与退货的影响","id":"试穿对转化与退货的影响"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"退货的规模与成因","id":"退货的规模与成因"},{"level":3,"text":"两条链路的符号可能相反","id":"两条链路的符号可能相反"},{"level":2,"text":"度量设计","id":"度量设计"},{"level":3,"text":"三个必须分开的指标","id":"三个必须分开的指标"},{"level":3,"text":"退货原因是可消费的数据","id":"退货原因是可消费的数据"},{"level":2,"text":"影响机制的拆解","id":"影响机制的拆解"},{"level":3,"text":"试穿在哪个环节起作用","id":"试穿在哪个环节起作用"},{"level":3,"text":"什么时候是净负效应","id":"什么时候是净负效应"},{"level":2,"text":"报告与归因","id":"报告与归因"},{"level":3,"text":"别引用无法核验的第三方数字","id":"别引用无法核验的第三方数字"},{"level":3,"text":"归因的实际困难","id":"归因的实际困难"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"模型多端加载与渐进式渲染","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-3d-ar-asset-virtualtryon/asset-sku-serving/3d-asset-cdn-loading"},"next":{"title":"3D/AR 覆盖品类优先级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-3d-ar-asset-virtualtryon/ar-conversion-ops/ar-asset-coverage-priority"}}